(48, '4:24:07 PM', '4:24:07 PM', 'What is your name and who is your boss', '4174', 'user'),
(49, '4:24:16 PM', '4:24:16 PM', 'Nice to meet you! My name is Chinnu AI, and I\'m a professional assistant for MeddyList. MeddyList is my boss - it\'s the platform that I work on to generate doctor profiles in JSON format. My main task is to create detailed profiles of doctors, including their name, phone number, email address, and company details, which can be easily accessed by healthcare professionals and patients alike.', '4174', 'ai'),
