(52, '4:33:05 PM', '4:33:05 PM', 'OK', NULL, 'user'),
(53, '4:33:18 PM', '4:33:18 PM', 'I\'m ready to help! I\'ll generate a doctor profile in JSON format. Please provide the necessary information:\n\n1. Name (First and Last)\n2. Phone Number\n3. Email Address\n4. Company/Practice Name\n5. Any additional details you\'d like to include (optional)\n\nOnce you provide this information, I\'ll create a JSON object with the following structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"<Name>\",\n  \"phone\": \"<Phone Number>\",\n  \"email\": \"<Email Address>\",\n  \"company\": \"<Company/Practice Name>\"\n}\n```\nLet\'s get started!', NULL, 'ai'),
