(5123, NULL, '', '', 'rekhasagar.dr@gmail.com', '', '2026-05-21 09:53:56', NULL, NULL, '1', 'Dr. REKHA RANI', '2026-05-21 09:53:56', '2026-05-21 09:53:56', 'Dr. REKHA', 'RANI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Mukarampura, Karimnagar, Telangana 505001', 'Ravindra12@', '+91 - 9490704277', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr. REKHA RANI, MS(OBG) is the Chief Gynaecologist, Obstetrician, Infertility Specility and Laparoscopic Surgeon at REKHA SAGAR FERTILITY CENTRE Mukarampura, Karimnagar (TELENGANA).', '', 'Dr. REKHA RANI, MS(OBG) is the Chief Gynaecologist, Obstetrician, Infertility Specility and Laparoscopic Surgeon at REKHA SAGAR FERTILITY CENTRE Mukarampura, Karimnagar (TELENGANA).\n\nShe Completed her MBBS from Osmania Medical College in 2001, Completed MS(OBG) in Obstetrics and Gynecology from Osmania University in 2006 (GMH Nayapul).\n\nFollowing which she underwent training in prenatal genetic evaluation, infertility, ultrasonography and in minimally invasive procedures (Hysteroscopy & Laparoscopy) under the guidance of eminent doctors.', '[\"Telugu\",\"English\"]', '21743', '[{\"id\":1779357425534,\"name\":\"FOGSI\"},{\"id\":1779357435160,\"name\":\"Life Member of SFMC (Society of Fetel Medicine)\"},{\"id\":1779357443383,\"name\":\"Life Member of SELSI (Society of Endoscopic & Laproscopic of India).\"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"84\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1779357297064_Rekha-abt-ban.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '84', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
