(5124, NULL, '', '', 'rekhabansal.example@gmail.com', '', '2026-05-21 10:53:09', NULL, NULL, '0', 'Dr. Rekha Bansal', '2026-05-21 10:53:09', '2026-05-21 10:53:09', 'Dr. Rekha', 'Bansal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'J/III, 8-2-293/82, Road No. 92, MLA Colony, Jubilee Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana 500033', 'Ravindra12@', '9705656070', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr. Rekha Bansal - Expert Medical Oncologist in Hyderabad', '', 'Dr. Rekha Bansal - Expert Medical Oncologist in Hyderabad\n\nDr. Rekha Bansal, DM (Medical Oncology), is a distinguished Medical Oncologist with over 8 years of dedicated experience in treating and managing complex oncological conditions. Specializing in Medical Oncology, Dr. Bansal is highly regarded for her expertise in treating Bone Tumors and Breast Cancer, as well as her exceptional care for patients with Colon Cancer.\n\nDr. Bansal’s approach to patient care is deeply patient-centric, focusing on personalized treatment plans tailored to each individual\'s needs. Her innovative methods and comprehensive care extend to the management of Head and Neck Cancer, as well as complex cases such as Kidney Cancer. Known for her thorough and empathetic approach, Dr. Bansal ensures that each patient receives the most effective and supportive care possible.\n\nHer commitment to excellence is reflected in her affiliations with top-tier institutions like Apollo Hospitals Jubilee Hills, where she benefits from cutting-edge technology and a collaborative medical environment. Dr. Bansal is also an active member of several recognized medical authorities, further enhancing her ability to provide top-quality care. Her contributions to the field are recognized through numerous awards and her impactful research, which advances the understanding and treatment of various cancers.\n\nFor expert Medical Oncology care in Hyderabad, Dr. Rekha Bansal offers unparalleled expertise and a compassionate approach. Book a consultation with Dr. Bansal today to receive comprehensive and personalized cancer care.', '[\"Telugu\",\"English\",\"Hindi\"]', '21859', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"88\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1779361018734_dr-rekha-bansal_1.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '88', NULL, '88', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
