(3539, 'doctor_dr.shashankachundurimd,dm-bestcardiologydoctorsinviza', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'doctor_dr-shashankachundurimddm-bestcardiologydoc', 'doctor_info@drshashankacardiologist.com', '', '2025-04-05 06:02:55', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Shashanka Chunduri', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Shashanka ', 'Chunduri ', '17.7172456', '83.3091869', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Apollo Hospital, Waltair Main Rd, Ram Nagar, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530002, India', NULL, '9849049442', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr. Shashanka Chunduri -Cardiology', '500', 'Dr. Shashanka Chunduri is a highly esteemed Cardiologist based in Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, boasting over 11 years of dedicated experience in the field of cardiology. As a qualified MD and DM, he is well-versed in the complexities of heart diseases and is committed to providing top-notch patient care.\n Dr. Chunduri is proficient in multiple languages, including English, Hindi, and Telugu, allowing him to effectively communicate with a diverse patient demographic. His skills and expertise in interventional cardiology have earned him prestigious recognition, including the title of \'Best Interventional Cardiologist in AP\' at the Asian Health Care Summit and Awards held in New Delhi in 2021. Furthermore, he is an esteemed member of the European Council on Valvular Heart Disease, highlighting his commitment to advancing the field of cardiology. Currently associated with Apollo Hospitals, Dr. Chunduri is dedicated to improving patient outcomes through advanced treatment options and compassionate care. His professional approach, combined with a breadth of knowledge, makes him a trusted name in the cardiology community. Patients seeking expert guidance on heart-related issues can rest assured that they are in the hands of a highly qualified specialist.', '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Telugu\"]', '1483', '[{\"id\":1748065663493,\"name\":\"Medical Council of India (MCI)\"},