(3589, 'dranithabestdoctorinvisakhapatdoctor4', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'dranithabestdoctorinvisakhapatdoctor4', 'dranithabestdoctorinvisakhapatdoctor4@gmail.com', '', '2025-04-05 06:07:09', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Venkatasubramanian Rangarajan ', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Venkatasubramanian', ' Rangarajan ', '17.76102', '83.317805', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Apollo Hospitals Health City Arilova Vizag, Srl No.78P & 76, Chinnadagili, Arilova, Hanumanthavaka, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530040, India', NULL, '4428290200', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr Venkatasubramanian Rangarajan - General Surgery', '500', 'Dr Venkatasubramanian Rangarajan is a distinguished General Surgery based at Apollo Hospitals Greams Road Chennai. With an impressive 16 years of experience in the medical field, he has dedicated his career to providing exceptional healthcare services to patients. He holds MBBS, MS, DNB, MNAMS, MRCS, FNB (Laproscopic Surgery), showcasing his extensive training and commitment to medical excellence. He is proficient in multiple languages, ensuring effective communication with a diverse range of patients.\n\nHe is known for his patient-centric approach, emphasizing the importance of understanding each patient\'s unique needs and medical history. He expertise encompasses a wide range of conditions related to General Surgery, enabling he to deliver precise diagnoses and treatments. He ensures that patients receive care tailored to their individual health requirements.\n\nIn his practice, Dr Venkatasubramanian Rangarajan goes beyond treatments by educating patients about their health conditions. This empowers individuals to take active roles in managing their health and making informed decisions. By fostering a supportive and understanding environment, he builds trust and ensures long-term health management strategies for patients.\n\nDedicated to staying updated with advancements in his field, Dr Venkatasubram