(3649, 'doctor_dr.chakradharpedada-bestcardiologydoctornearme|cardia', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'doctor_dr-chakradharpedada-bestcardiologydoctornea', 'doctor_info_1743833679@apollo247.com', '', '2025-04-05 06:14:39', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Chakradhar Pedada', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Chakradhar', ' Pedada', '17.761461', '83.3178251', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Apollo Hospitals Health City Unit Health City, Chinagadili, Arilova, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530040, India', NULL, '7989191843', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr.chakradhar Pedada- Cardiology', '500', 'Dr. Chakradhar Pedada is a skilled and dedicated Cardiologist based in Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh. With an impressive educational background, including an MBBS, MD, and DM, Dr. Pedada has accumulated two years of experience in the field of cardiology, making him a valuable asset to his patients. As a male physician specializing in cardiac care, he is committed to providing comprehensive care for a range of heart-related conditions.\n\nFluent in multiple languages, including English, Hindi, Telugu, and Malayalam, he is well-equipped to communicate effectively with a diverse patient population. Dr. Pedada\'s expertise in cardiology is further demonstrated by his active participation in several prestigious conferences, where he has presented papers and case studies. Notable among his contributions are presentations at TCT-2019 in San Francisco, CSI-2019 in Delhi, and ICCCON-2019 in Kochi, Kerala.\n\nThroughout his career, he has received accolades for his work in the medical community, highlighting his commitment to advancing knowledge and treatment in cardiology. Dr. Pedada\'s focus on patient-centered care ensures that each individual receives personalized attention and treatment tailored to their specific needs. As part of the Apollo healthcare system, patients can expect high-quality care and access to state-of-the-art medical facilities.\n\nWhethe