(3674, 'doctor_dr.ramyavarada-bestendocrinologistinvisakhapatnam|man', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'doctor_dr-ramyavarada-bestendocrinologistinvisakha', 'doctor_info_1743833823@apollo247.com', '', '2025-04-05 06:17:03', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Ramya Varada', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Ramya', 'Varada', '17.7614', '83.317', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Q868+HR2 Apollo Hospitals Health City Unit Health City, Chinagadili, Arilova, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530040, India', NULL, '8605001066', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr Ramya Varada -  Endocrinology & Diabetes Care', '1000', 'Dr. Ramya Varada is a distinguished Endocrinologist based in Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, with six years of extensive experience in the field. Holding an MD and DM, she has honed her expertise in diagnosing and treating hormonal disorders, metabolic issues, and diseases of the endocrine system. Dr. Varada takes a comprehensive approach to patient care, emphasizing both medical treatment and lifestyle modifications to enhance overall health and well-being.\n\nFluent in English, Hindi, and Telugu, Dr. Varada caters to a diverse patient population, ensuring clear communication and understanding. Her commitment to patient education is evident in her practice, where she strives to empower individuals with the knowledge and resources they need to manage their conditions effectively.\n\nShe is currently affiliated with Apollo Hospitals, a leading healthcare institution known for its high standards and quality of care. Dr. Varada remains updated with the latest advancements in endocrinology, participating in continuous education and professional development opportunities to provide her patients with the best possible care.\n\nDr. Ramya Varada is dedicated to improving the lives of her patients and holds a reputable position in the medical community. Her compassionate nature and professional integrity make her a trusted choice for patients seeking 