(4639, 'dr_padma_keerthi', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'dr_padma_keerthi', 'padma.keerthi@example.com', '', '2025-04-25 11:03:24', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr  K Padma Keerthi', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr  K Padma ', 'Keerthi', '17.5109', '78.3468', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Room no:205, Siddarth hospital Beside, South India, shopping mall, Madeenaguda, Telangana 500049', NULL, '4020202000', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr  K Padma Keerthi -  MBBS, MS - ENT', '500', 'Dr. Padma Keerthi K is a Ear-Nose-Throat (ENT) Specialist and ENT/ Otorhinolaryngologist in JP Nagar, Bangalore and has an experience of 13 years in these fields. Dr. Padma Keerthi K practices at Practo Instant Hybrid Clinic in JP Nagar, Bangalore. She completed MBBS from Dr. NTR University of Health Sciences Andhra Pradesh in 2012 and MS - ENT from Gandhi Medical College and Hospital, Secunderabad in 2020.\n\nSome of the services provided by the doctor are: Ear-Nose-Throat (ENT) and Ear-Nose-Throat (Ent) Specialist etc', '[\"English\",\"Telugu\"]', '2063', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"id\":\"ent_specialist_001\",\"name\":\"ENT Surgery\",\"description\":\"Expert in diagnosing and treating various ear, nose, and throat disorders.\"}]', NULL, NULL, '2064', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1749728830402_AF1QipO3lcTdkOzP-30aUphiOxUNVFvk.png', '0', 'Padma_Keerthi_ENT', NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1749728822818_dr-padma-keerthi-k-ear-nose-thro.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4642, 'dr_silpa_chiranjeevi', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'dr_silpa_chiranjeevi', 'dr.silpa.chiranjeevi@example.com', '', '2025-04-25 11:09:59', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr  Silpa Ponnada', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr  Silpa ', 'Ponnada', '17.4797', '78.4090', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, '1st Floor, 162, Rd Number 1, above Chiranjeevi Hospitals, Kukatpally Housing Board Colony, Kukatpally, Hyderabad, Telangana 500085', NULL, '9581299555', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr  Silpa Ponnada - Senior Consultant Dermatologist & Aesthetic Specialist', '500', 'Dr. Silpa Ponnada is an accomplished Senior Consultant Dermatologist and Aesthetic Specialist at Chiranjeevi Cutis Care, a prestigious branch of Chiranjeevi Hospitals in Kukatpally, Hyderabad. She earned her MBBS (2008-2014) from ASRAM Medical College, Eluru, and later completed her MD in Dermatology, Venereology, and Leprosy (2015-2018) from GMC, Guntur. With a deep passion for dermatology and cosmetology, Dr. Ponnada excels in diagnosing and treating a broad spectrum of skin conditions, including psoriasis, eczema, vitiligo, and other chronic skin diseases. Her remarkable skills in cosmetic procedures such as Botox, fillers, and chemical peeling have garnered her recognition for excellence. Dr. Ponnada is also a pioneer in advanced therapies like PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma) and GFC (Growth Factor Concentrate), offering treatments for hair loss, chronic non-healing ulcers, and skin rejuvenation. Her proficiency with IPL (Intense Pulsed Light) and Laser treatments for skin rejuvenation and hair removal further enhances her ability to deliver comprehensive aesthetic solutions. Dr. Ponnada?s commitment to continuous learning is demonstrated by her active participation in numerous workshops and conferences, including on HIV management, Botox and fillers, Trichology updates, and Dermatosurgery. She has presented award papers on PRP in chronic non-healing ulcers, reinforcing her position as a leader in dermatology and aesthetic care.', '[\"English\",\"Telugu\"]', '28213', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"id\":917,\"name\":\"Skin Care\",\"description\":\"Treatments and procedures for various skin conditions, including acne, pigmentation, and aging.\"},\"2\":{\"id\":918,\"name\":\"Hair Restoration\",\"description\":\"Hair treatments for thinning hair, hair loss, and restoration using advanced methods.\"},\"3\":{\"id\":919,\"name\":\"Laser Aesthetic Procedures\",\"description\":\"Non-invasive laser treatments for skin rejuvenation, hair removal, and scar reduction.\"}}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1749798209959_LOGO_921.png', '1', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1781077367139_WhatsApp Image 2025-02-11 at 9.16.56 PM.jpeg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4643, 'dr_rajasekhar_reddy', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'dr_rajasekhar_reddy', 'dr.rajasekhar.reddy@example.com', '', '2025-04-25 11:10:40', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Rajasekhar Reddy', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Rajasekhar ', 'Reddy', '17.4853', '78.4055', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, '1st Floor, Road Number- 4 Landmark: Beside Vijaya Diagnostics Opposite Kalanjali Shopping Mall, Kukatpally Housing Board Colony, Hyderabad, Telangana 500072', NULL, '9000572727', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr Rajasekhar Reddy - Dermatologist ', '500', 'Dr. Rajasekhar is a Dermatologist in Kukatpally, Hyderabad and has an experience of 15 years in this field. Dr. Rajasekhar practices at Layers Clinics in Kukatpally, Hyderabad. He completed MBBS from Dr. NTR University of Health Sciences Andhra Pradesh in 2010 and MD - Dermatology , Venereology & Leprosy from The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University (TNMGRMU) in 2017.\n\nSome of the services provided by the doctor are: Photofacial,Skin Tightening,Double Chin Treatment,BOTOX and Skin Peeling etc.', '[\"English\",\"Tamil\",\"Telugu\"]', '2072', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"id\":932,\"name\":\"Spine Surgery\",\"description\":\"Advanced spine surgery techniques for treating herniated discs, scoliosis, and other spinal conditions.\"},\"2\":{\"id\":933,\"name\":\"Neuro Surgery\",\"description\":\"Minimally invasive neuro surgery for treating brain and spinal cord disorders.\"},\"3\":{\"id\":934,\"name\":\"Pain Management\",\"description\":\"Specialized treatment for chronic pain, including nerve blocks and other interventions.\"}}', NULL, NULL, '2073', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1749799234185_layers-clinics-hyderabad-5f8d4c8.png', '1', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1749799226111_dr-rajasekhar-dermatologist-hyde.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,