(4775, 'dr_aastitv_doc', '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', 'dr_aastitv_doc', 'aastitv.doc@example.com', '', '2025-04-28 11:32:21', 'doctor', '', '0', 'Dr Beena Valandi ', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', '2025-05-03 18:08:13', 'Dr Beena ', 'Valandi ', '17.4401', '78.4483', NULL, 'doctor', NULL, '5TH FLOOR, HOTEL NEW SREE KRISHNA RESIDENCY, COLONY, above UNIFORM HOUSE, Sanjeeva Reddy Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana 500038', NULL, '4049172575', NULL, NULL, 'female', 'Dr Beena Valandi (Plastic/Cosmetic Surgeon)', '700', 'She is board certified Plastic Surgeon with years of experience in Plastic,Aesthetic and Reconstructive surgeries, she is specialized in reconstructive surgeries and advanced aesthetic procedures. She graduated MBBS from RGUHS university and later on went to be surgical intern in U. S, with keen interest in this field of medicine.Later she gained experience by working in plastic surgery department in Manipal hospital , Bangalore. Following which She completed DNB training in Bangalore and was awarded DNB plastic surgery by Diplomat of national board,New Delhi,trained in plastic surgery in advanced trauma and reconstructive surgery center,Sparsh hospital, Narayana health city,Bangalore for extensive 6 years,under very skilled and leading plastic surgeon,she has developed tremendous cosmetic,reconstructive and Microvascular surgery skills by travelling,interacting and working with various senior surgeons in the field, After completing DNB Plastic surgery, she has given honorary services in plastic surgery department of Nizam\'s Hyderarbad and ESIC hospital Sanathnagar, Dr. Beena has been awarded FAM Fellowship in aesthetic medicine degree from Institute of laser and aesthetic medicine,University Medicine Greifswald, German. She is active life member of Association of Plastic Surgeons of India(APSI), Indian Association of Aesthetic Plastic Surgeons(IAAPS),I ndian Society of Aesthetic Medicine(ISAM), Association of Plastic,Reconstructive and Aesthetic Surgeons AP AND TELANGANA(APRAS)', '[\"English\",\"Telugu\",\"Hindi\"]', '2299', '[{\"id\":1750317892173,\"name\":\"APSI, IAAPS, ISAM, APRAS\"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"General Medicine\",\"description\":\"Expert diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic illnesses.\"}', NULL, NULL, '2298', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1750317860675_aastitv-hyderabad-66bb08abe6237.png', '0', 'aastitv-hospital-sanjeeva-reddy-nagar', NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1750317873873_dr-beena-valandi-plastic-surgeon.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
