(4978, NULL, '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', '', 'mohdirtaza94@gmail.com', '', '2025-07-21 08:19:33', NULL, NULL, '0', 'Dr. Mohd Irtaza', '2025-07-21 08:19:33', '2025-07-21 08:19:33', 'Dr Mohd', ' Irtaza', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, NULL, NULL, '8775001066', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr. Mohd Irtaza - onsultant in Gastroenterology & Hepatology', '1000', 'Dr. Mohd Irtaza is a distinguished Gastroenterology/GI Medicine Specialist based in South Delhi, Delhi, with over 11 years of experience in the field. He holds an extensive educational background with qualifications including MBBS, MD in Internal Medicine, and DM in Gastroenterology. Dr. Irtaza is dedicated to providing exceptional care to his patients, utilizing his expertise to diagnose and treat a range of gastrointestinal conditions. His commitment to professional development is exemplified by his memberships in prestigious organizations, such as the American College of Gastroenterology and the Indian Society of Gastroenterology. Fluent in both English and Hindi, Dr. Irtaza ensures effective communication with patients from diverse backgrounds, making them feel comfortable and understood. He currently practices at Apollo, where he combines his clinical skills with a compassionate approach to patient care, striving for improved health outcomes. With a solid reputation in the community, Dr. Irtaza is recognized for his thoroughness and diligence in managing complex gastrointestinal issues. His patients appreciate not only his medical knowledge but also his empathetic demeanor, as he takes the time to listen and address their concerns. As a prominent figure in the field of gastroenterology, Dr. Mohd Irtaza is committed to advancing his practice and providing the highest standard of care to his patients in South Delhi.', '[\"English\",\"Hindi\"]', '20195', '[{\"id\":1753086655689,\"name\":\"Indian Society of Gastroenterology (ISG)\"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"45\"]', '', NULL, '2942', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1753086645438_apollo hospitals.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1779269904605_download (14).jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '45', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
