(4982, NULL, '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', '', 'rajeevshandil994@gmail.com', '', '2025-07-21 09:41:03', NULL, NULL, '0', 'Dr. Rajeev Shandil', '2025-07-21 09:41:03', '2025-07-21 09:41:03', 'Dr Rajeev ', 'Shandil', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, NULL, NULL, '8985001066', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr. Rajeev Shandil - Medical Gastroenterology and Hepatology', '1500', 'Dr. Rajeev Shandil is an esteemed Gastroenterology/GI Medicine Specialist based in South Delhi, Delhi. With over 15 years of experience in the medical field, he has established himself as a trusted healthcare provider. Dr. Shandil holds multiple qualifications, including an MBBS, DNB in Internal Medicine, and DNB in Gastroenterology, which equip him with extensive knowledge and expertise in treating various gastrointestinal disorders. Fluent in English, Hindi, and Punjabi, he is able to effectively communicate with a diverse patient population. As an exclusive partner, Dr. Shandil prides himself on offering personalized patient care, ensuring that each individual\'s needs are met with compassion and professionalism. He is dedicated to staying abreast of the latest advancements in gastroenterology and employs evidence-based practices to deliver optimal outcomes. Dr. Rajeev Shandil is committed to enhancing patients\' quality of life by providing comprehensive evaluations, diagnoses, and treatments for conditions related to the digestive system. Whether managing chronic illnesses or addressing acute gastrointestinal issues, patients can trust that they are in capable hands.', '[\"English\",\"Hindi\"]', '20322', '[{\"id\":1753091043599,\"name\":\"Society of Gastrointestinal Endoscopy of India (SGEI)\"},{\"id\":1753091053991,\"name\":\"Indian Motility & Functional Disease Association (IMFDA)\"},{\"id\":1753091062127,\"name\":\"Indian College of Endoscopy (ICE)\"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"45\"]', '', NULL, '2956', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/175