(6531, NULL, '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', '', 'drpneelima733@meddylist.import', '', '2026-06-11 07:34:33', NULL, NULL, '1', 'Dr. P. Neelima', '2026-06-11 13:04:34', '2026-06-11 13:04:34', 'Dr.', 'P. Neelima', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Renova Neelima Hospital - Sanath Nagar Plot No. 7-2-1735, Opp. Voltas Company Pvt Ltd, Sanath Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana 500018 info.rnh@renovahospitals.com View directions', 'Ravindra12@', '040 2333 3333', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '500', 'Dr P. Neelima is a highly respected gynaecologist and obstetrician with over 27 years of clinical experience. She is the Founder of Neelima Hospital and Managing Director of Neelima Private Limited, and currently serves as Senior Consultant and Head of the Department of Obstetrics & Gynaecology at Renova Neelima Hospital. She is widely recognised among the top doctors in gynaecology for her leadership, clinical expertise, and patient-focused care.A skilled laparoscopic surgeon, fertility specialist, and Professor for the DNB postgraduate program, Dr Neelima is trusted as a doctor of obstetrics and gynaecology, delivering advanced, evidence-based women’s healthcare. Patients seeking the best gynaecology doctor in Hyderabad or a leading gynaecology specialist value her comprehensive approach across all stages of a woman’s', '[\"English\",\"Telugu\",\"Hindi\"]', '28288', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'High risk obstetrics Laparoscopy Fertility services | Professional Skill | Dr P. Neelima provides advanced, specialised gynaecology and obstetrics care and is regarded as one of the best gynaecology doctors in Hyderabad.Endometriosis CareExpert diagnosis and advanced management of endometriosis with a focus on long-term relief and fertility preservation.Adolescent GynecologyDedicated adolescent clinics addressing menstrual, hormonal, and developmental concerns with compassionate counselling.Menopause ManagementComprehensive menopause care focusing on symptom control, hormonal balance, and long-term health.PCOS / PCO ClinicSpecialised evaluation and treatment of PCO/PCOS, offering personalised, multidisciplinary management plans | Reach out to us | Request for an appointment | we will call you in next 2 hours to confirm the earliest appointment | 🇮🇳 India (+91) | Submit', 'MBBS,MD (Obs &Gyn), Head of the Department (HOD)', NULL, '[\"84\"]', '/uploads/3/doctors/1781164012574_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://apis.oneklicks.com/uploads/3/doctors/1781164012574_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '84', NULL, 'Gynaecology & Obstetrics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
