etic surgery, including rhinoplasty, abdominoplasty, thighplasty, and other body contouring techniques, helping patients enhance their appearance with minimal recovery time.Expertise in Hair TransplantationSkilled in hair transplantation, offering state-of-the-art solutions for hair restoration with natural-looking results.Ear Reconstruction & Craniofacial SurgeriesProficient in ear reconstruction and complex craniofacial surgeries, providing functional and aesthetic solutions for congenital or traumatic conditions.Extensive Research & Global Academic ContributionsDr Dudipala has contributed extensively to the academic field with research publications and has introduced groundbreaking techniques in plastic surgery, including a novel grading system for ear reconstruction. | Reach out to us | Request for an appointment | we will call you in next 2 hours to confirm the earliest appointment | 🇮🇳 India (+91) | Submit', 'MBBS – Pune, Maharashtra | MS (General Surgery) – Pune, Maharashtra | M.Ch (Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery) – Amrita Institute of Medical Sciences, Kochi | Fellowship – Minimal Access & Robotic Surgery | Gyan Burman Fellowship – Hepato-biliary & Pancreatic Surgery, Sir Ganga Ram Hospital, New Delhi', NULL, '[\"113\"]', '/uploads/3/doctors/1781164021885_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://apis.oneklicks.com/uploads/3/doctors/1781164021885_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '113', NULL, 'Plastic Surgery', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
