stroke, diabetic ketoacidosis, and other acute illnesses.Interventional Bedside Procedures Proficient in thoracocentesis, paracentesis, and lumbar puncture procedures.Medico-Legal Case Management Extensive experience in handling medico-legal cases with structured documentation and evaluation.Chronic Disease Management Long-term care for diabetes, hypertension, thyroid disorders, and lifestyle-related illnesses.Academic & Clinical Mentorship Active involvement in teaching, research presentations, and mentoring medical and paramedical professionals. | Reach out to us | Request for an appointment | we will call you in next 2 hours to confirm the earliest appointment | 🇮🇳 India (+91) | Submit', 'MBBS, MD (General Medicine), DNB, MRCP (UK)', NULL, '[\"47\"]', '/uploads/3/doctors/1781164035390_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://apis.oneklicks.com/uploads/3/doctors/1781164035390_undefined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '47', NULL, 'General Medicine', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(6556, NULL, '738e517ee81bfee84d0f5ae6808bd53f2c5e93c14c9610c2097aef19d9b732f0', '', 'dravinashvattam192@meddylist.import', '', '2026-06-11 07:34:55', NULL, NULL, '1', 'Dr. Avinash Vattam', '2026-06-11 13:04:56', '2026-06-11 13:04:56', 'Dr.', 'Avinash Vattam', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'doctor', NULL, 'Renova Neelima Hospital - Sanath Nagar Plot No. 7-2-1735, Opp. Voltas Company Pvt Ltd, Sanath Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana 500018 info.rnh@renovahospitals.com View directions', 'Ravindra12@', '040 2333 3333', NULL, NULL, 'male', 'Dr. Avinash Vattam is a specialist in Degrees at Renova Hospitals.', '500', 'Dr. Avinash Vattam is an experienced Consultant Paediatrician and Pediatric Nephrologist with over 12 years of clinical experience in providing comprehensive healthcare for children. He began his medical career at Renova Neelima Hospital, Sanath Nagar, where he gained extensive experience in diagnosing and treating a wide range of pediatric conditions.\n\n\n\nFollowing his tenure at Renova Neelima Hospital, he worked at Swapna Health Care, Begumpet, further strengthening his expertise in child healthcare and preventive medicine. He is currently associated with Little Stars and She Hospital, Banjara Hills, and Marwellus Clinics and Diagnostics Center, Kukatpally, where he provides specialized pediatric and pediatric nephrology services.\n\n\n\n\nDr. Avinash completed his MBBS from Mamata Medical College, Khammam, and secured 4th rank in his class for overall academic performance. He went on to pursue DNB Pediatrics from Lilavati Hospital and Research Centre, Mumbai, followed by a Fellowship in Pediatric Nephrology.\n\n\n\nHis areas of expertise include the management of childhood illnesses, growth and developmental concerns, vaccinations, urinary tract infections, congenital kidney disorders, acute kidney injury, and chronic kidney disease. Known for his compassionate approach and patient-focused care, Dr. Avinash is committed to ensuring the best possible health outcomes for children at every stage of their development.', '[\"English\",\"Telugu\",\"Hindi\"]', '28328', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Professional Skill | Reach out to us | Request for an appointment | we will call you in next 2 hours to confirm the earliest appointment | 🇮🇳 India (+91) | Submit', 'MBBS', NULL, '[\"68\"]', '/uploads/3/doctors/1781164035910_undefined', NULL, '28327', '/uploads/3/doctors/banner/1781178984596_1769143010183-977324919.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '/uploads/3/doctors/profile/1781179019859_1769143010183-977324919.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '68', NULL, '107', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
